{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-switch-phone-tracker-components-1-a-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-1","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-components-1","refs":["F-phone-721","F-phone-720","F-phone-715"],"severity":"S3","title":"The plus and minus buttons and the watch dial ignore the member's machine steps and plates","what":"A member who sets Machine and cable steps to 5 kg, or says their gym has no small plates, gets suggested weights on that grid. But the plus and minus buttons on the keyboard while typing a set, and the watch dial ('Turn the dial, 2.5 kg steps'), still move by the exercise's fixed library step, usually 2.5 kg. One tap lands on a weight the gym's machine or bar cannot make.","expected":"The plus and minus buttons and the watch dial move in the same steps the suggestions use: the member's machine and cable step, and the bar weights their plates can make.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/components/MachineStepCard.tsx:1-6","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/setEntry.ts:52-56","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/setEntry.ts:112-120","apps/mobile/src/tracker/store/activeWorkoutStore.ts:2295-2303","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/liveCard.ts:98","apps/mobile/modules/forge-rest/android/src/main/java/com/forgeai/rest/WearSync.kt:222","apps/mobile/android/wear/src/main/java/com/forgeai/wear/WatchLog.kt:136","apps/mobile/src/tracker/engine/progression.ts:478-486"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"entry-steps-ignore-machine-step-plates","who":"members who changed Machine and cable steps or Plates and bars","how_often":"every plus or minus tap, or dial turn, on a machine, cable or barbell exercise","fix_line":"Work out the plus and minus step from the same machine-step and plates rules the suggestions use","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-switch-phone-tracker-components-1-a-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-1","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-components-1","refs":["F-phone-736","F-phone-723","FN-B-switch-phone-screens-1-a-04"],"severity":"S4","title":"A muscle tip can suggest adding an exercise the member hid","what":"When no routine trains a muscle, the muscle tip on the Workout tab offers to add a library exercise, such as Standing Calf Raise. It picks from a fixed list and never checks the member's hidden exercises, so it can offer the exact exercise the member hid from every list.","expected":"The muscle tip skips hidden exercises and picks the next one on its list.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/muscleTips.ts:186-196","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/muscleTips.ts:253","apps/mobile/src/tracker/components/ExercisePickerList.tsx:116-125"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"muscle-tip-ignores-hidden-exercises","who":"members who hid library exercises","how_often":"when a tip's first pick is a hidden exercise","fix_line":"Skip hidden exercises when the muscle tip picks what to add","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
